     Organizational learning looks at an organization as a thinking system. Orga-
nizations rely on feedback to adjust to a changing world. Thus, organizations
engage in complex processes such as anticipating, perceiving, envisioning, and
problem-solving in order to learn. This approach is very important for new tech-
